  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the reported figure of earth, the value of acceleration due to gravity is same at point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;but it is smaller than that of its value at point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> (surface of the earth). The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1e4d0b7b-cbfa-4902-a9ff-047584631b2a-image.png\" style=\"width: 152px; height: 204px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/70432cb4-6947-47a3-9f59-48d091e4767d-image.png\" style=\"width: 178px; height: 207px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mi>r</mi></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
